OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly cloudy start with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain across southern and
OL,7,Feastern counties. Drier, brighter
OL,8,Fconditions across the northwest spread
OL,9,Fto all parts through the morning to
OL,10,Fleave the afternoon largely dry with
OL,11,Fsunny spells. Mainly light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRisk of some rain in the far
OL,14,Fsoutheast this evening, otherwise most
OL,15,Fplaces dry with long clear spells
OL,16,Fovernight, just a few showers for
OL,17,Fwestern counties and the north coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
