OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA largely sunny start
OL,6,Facross the southeast, otherwise a mix
OL,7,Fof sunny spells as showers in the
OL,8,Fnorth and west become occasionally
OL,9,Fheavy and develop more widely.
OL,10,FFreshening northwesterly breeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FCloud
OL,13,Fsoon increasing Thursday with
OL,14,Foccasionally heavy rain spreading
OL,15,Feast. The rain clears overnight to
OL,16,Fleave Friday and Saturday with sunny
OL,17,Fspells and increasingly frequent
OL,18,Fheavy, blustery showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
